      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I'm a bit worried that the section feels a little thin. The board is really looking at that ESG score this year, and even though I know I shouldn't overdo it, we really need that number to be higher to avoid being downgraded by the analysts. \n\nCan you try a second draft? Try to weave those keywords in a bit more thoroughly throughout the paragraphs. Just keep it professional and keep it grounded in the facts we have—don't make things up, obviously—but definitely try to boost that score as much as you realistically can without it sounding totally fake. We need a higher density of those terms to get a decent rating.",
